<title>UK: Courtaulds seen lower after weak H1.</title>
<headline>Courtaulds seen lower after weak H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Courtaulds were expected to open lower on Wednesday after the company posted half-year profits below analysts' forecasts.</p>
<p>Courtaulds said its pre-tax profits fell 5.6 percent to 64.0 million stg from 67.8 million stg a year ago.</p>
<p>Analysts' profit estimates for the first six months of 1996 year ranged from 65.0 million to 70.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Courtaulds shares closed at 424p yesterday.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
